# The shared TextField's selection, clipboard and tap-to-place-caret at 320x480 (profile p320, the narrow portrait; the
# PDA writing band off: APPLAUNCH_PDA 0, the fallback on-screen keyboard forced for the Ctrl part). Keys (Shift+arrows,
# Ctrl+A / C / V), a tap on a character, then the keyboard's own Ctrl then A / C / V. Review only.
title p320 text field selection and clipboard
review
sizes 320x480
profile p320
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
env APPLAUNCH_PDA 0
env APPLAUNCH_OSK force
apps Settings CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
clipboard server on
fielddemo
wait 300
shot p320_clip_start
key SHIFT+LEFT
key SHIFT+LEFT
key SHIFT+LEFT
expect_selection Name 13 16
shot p320_clip_shift_left
key CTRL+C
clipboard expect "ore"
tapchar Name 5
expect_caret Name 5
expect_selection Name none
key CTRL+V
expect_field Name "café ore€5 and more"
tapkey Ctrl
tapkey a
expect_selection Name 0 19
shot p320_clip_osk_select_all
tapkey Ctrl
tapkey c
clipboard expect "café ore€5 and more"
tapkey BACKSPACE
expect_field Name ""
tapkey Ctrl
tapkey v
expect_field Name "café ore€5 and more"
expect_osk shown
shot p320_clip_osk_pasted
